<title>SINGAPORE: United Engineers 1996 net up 54 pct.</title>
<headline>United Engineers 1996 net up 54 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     15.05 vs   9.79</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cts)		  3.00 vs   3.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)		     9.70 vs   6.30</p>
<p>    Group share fully diluted (cts)   6.40 vs   4.20</p>
<p>    Turnover				494.23 vs 369.90</p>
<p>    Investment income		     0.11 vs   0.07</p>
